Subject: [PATCH] topaz-0127: PM6125 RTC wall clock via SPMI

Read the PM8941-compatible RTC on PM6125 (SID0 @0x6000) over the same
SPMI arbiter as the keys driver. Override SweetPlatformExpert
get/setGMTTimeOfDay and push clock_set_calendar_microtime once UFS
bring-up has mapped SPMI, so the UI is not stuck on 31 December.

Raw Qualcomm counts are often GPS-epoch relative; if the value already
looks like Unix (>= 2021-01-01) it is used as-is, else GPS epoch
315964800 is added. Boot-arg sweetrtoffset=N overrides the addend
(sweetrtoffset=-1 disables the GPS adjustment). sweetrton=0 disables.

